== 4. Interpretation guide ===================================== 
  A NEGATIVE methylation-expression correlation supports silencing. 
  HIGHER promoter beta in metastases would support Gustavo's premise 
  that RASSF10 is epigenetically silenced in metastatic melanoma. 
  Note median beta values: a promoter sitting near beta = 0 is 
  unmethylated in most tumours, which limits how much expression 
  variation methylation could possibly explain. 

